ckground-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">7月23日</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ひらがなけやき2期生である、河田陽菜の誕生日でした~✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ひなおめでとう~♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">華のセブンティーン💫</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">いつもニコニコしてて、その笑顔に癒されてます♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">しっかりお祝いできなくてごめんねm(*_ _)m</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これからも頑張ろうね~(๑&nbsp;˙˘˙)/</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">17歳おめでとう✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">✽・:..｡o￠o｡..:・✽・:..｡o￠o｡..:・✽・:..｡o￠</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">7月25日&nbsp;発売</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">週刊少年マガジンさん</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">丹生明里・渡邉美穂・小坂菜緒の3人で表紙を飾らせていただきました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">「キレイになりたい」で初めての少年誌で、しかも表紙を飾らせていただけるなんて…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当に本当に嬉しかったです💫</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/image